#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""fb2opt — lossless optimization of FB2 books (.fb2.zip).

One file, three modes:
  optimize (default) — recompress images (PNG/JPEG) and XML, repack the ZIP;
  --extract          — pull images into the current folder;
  --pack             — put images from the current folder back into a book.

Replacement rule:
  the new file replaces the old one ONLY if (old_size - new_size) > 0,
  otherwise the original is left untouched.

The result line shows total saved bytes on disk, followed — in the same
brackets — by the unpacked-FB2 breakdown by type: xml (markup), png, jpg.
"""

